  unitName: Dark Tunes Eric
  unitId: 60364
  unitNumber: 546
  description: A former cavalry leader who wanders through the Bariura Empire as
    a musician. An old friend of Magress' father, he has lent the hero advice on
    numerous occasions when he was blinded by his quest for revenge. Magress never
    noticed, however, for Eric's youthful appearance always fooled him. He even fought
    alongside the locals in the war against the gods, though his modifications were
    starting to distort his power and cause it to run wild unbeknownst to him.
  summonDesc: I'm but a wandering minstrel.<br>Just here to add a little<br>hue to
    your journey...
  fusionDesc: Youngsters might get happy.<br>But this isn't something to<br>dance
    and shout about.
  evoDesc: Don't judge me by my looks.<br>I'll show you through my<br>actions that
    I've evolved.
  element: 6
  rarity: 4
